    - text: "M\xECnh ph\u1EA3i r\u1EDDi kh\u1ECFi \u0111\xE2y. Ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c.
        Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u1EDF l\u1EA1i c\u0103n ph\xF2ng n\xE0y."
      duration: 4
    logMonologuesToLog: 1
